{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20191","headline":"听蓝溪僧爲元居士说维摩经 · 孟郊","name":"听蓝溪僧爲元居士说维摩经","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古树少枝叶，真僧亦相依。\n山木自曲直，道人无是非。\n手持维摩偈，心向居士归。\n空景忽开霁，雪花犹在衣。\n洗然水溪昼，寒物生光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}